WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.942
Read the video transcript The four panels are separate

00:00:02.955 --> 00:00:08.745
checks Being competent does not create authority Having system

00:00:08.785 --> 00:00:11.785
access does not prove that the information is reliable

00:00:11.824 --> 00:00:15.851
or that enough capacity is available The record links

00:00:15.877 --> 00:00:20.430
a result to its scope conditions decision route evidence

00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:24.403
and review point This makes limits visible before the

00:00:24.455 --> 00:00:28.956
assistant accepts the work The cards distinguish an individual

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:33.943
account from an approved delegation Approved delegated access is

00:00:33.943 --> 00:00:37.851
not the same as sharing another person’s password Use

00:00:37.903 --> 00:00:40.588
the organisation’s actual access controls
